<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no">
<title>Harbour City</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #0a0f1a;
    --amber: #ffb347;
    --cyan: #6fd6ff;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #070b14;
    color: #e8eefc;
    font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  #scene {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    touch-action: none;
    cursor: grab;
  }

  #scene:active { cursor: grabbing; }

  #hud {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* Read aloud, never shown: the status line screen readers announce. */
  #status {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  #overlay {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 3;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 42%, rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.14), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 108%, rgba(111, 214, 255, 0.14), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(8, 13, 24, 0.26) 0%, rgba(7, 11, 20, 0.52) 58%, rgba(5, 8, 15, 0.8) 100%);
    backdrop-filter: blur(1.5px) saturate(1.05);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(1.5px) saturate(1.05);
    transition: opacity 480ms ease, visibility 480ms ease;
  }

  #overlay.hidden {
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .panel {
    width: min(560px, 100%);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 32px 34px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(111, 214, 255, 0.16);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12, 19, 33, 0.92), rgba(8, 13, 24, 0.96));
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .kicker {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.42em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(111, 214, 255, 0.78);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 7vw, 62px);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff6e6 0%, #ffca7a 55%, #ff9f3c 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 24px rgba(255, 159, 60, 0.28));
  }

  .rule {
    width: 86px;
    height: 2px;
    margin: 22px auto 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--amber), transparent);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .sub {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(232, 238, 252, 0.62);
    max-width: 40ch;
    margin: 0 auto 26px;
  }

  #play {
    appearance: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 15px 46px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #150d02;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffd08a, #ffab3f);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(255, 159, 60, 0.32), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    transition: transform 140ms ease, box-shadow 140ms ease, filter 140ms ease;
  }

  #play:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); filter: brightness(1.06); }
  #play:active { transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.995); }
  #play:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--cyan); outline-offset: 4px; }

  .controls {
    margin-top: 26px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px 18px;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: rgba(232, 238, 252, 0.5);
  }

  .controls span { white-space: nowrap; }

  kbd {
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 22px;
    padding: 3px 6px;
    margin-right: 5px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 238, 252, 0.22);
    border-bottom-width: 2px;
    background: rgba(232, 238, 252, 0.07);
    color: rgba(232, 238, 252, 0.86);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .hint {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(111, 214, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .briefs {
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .brief {
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.18);
    background: rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.05);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(255, 214, 170, 0.7);
  }

  .brief.wanted {
    border-color: rgba(255, 96, 78, 0.26);
    background: rgba(255, 74, 60, 0.07);
    color: rgba(255, 200, 188, 0.76);
  }

  .brief b {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 203, 130, 0.95);
  }

  .brief.wanted b { color: rgba(255, 138, 118, 0.95); }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .panel { padding: 30px 20px 26px; border-radius: 16px; }
    .controls { gap: 6px 12px; font-size: 11px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <canvas id="scene" aria-label="Harbour City: a dusk city you can walk through"></canvas>
  <canvas id="hud"></canvas>
  <p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

  <div id="overlay">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="kicker">Dusk District &middot; Sector 9</div>
      <h1>HARBOUR CITY</h1>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p class="sub">The sun has gone down behind the towers and the avenues are full of traffic. Take a car off the kerb, run four jobs for people who pay cash and ask nothing, and keep one eye on the mirror: this city counts your stars.</p>
      <button id="play" type="button">Play</button>
      <div class="controls">
        <span><kbd>WASD</kbd> move</span>
        <span><kbd>Shift</kbd> sprint</span>
        <span><kbd>Space</kbd> jump / brake</span>
        <span><kbd>F</kbd> in / out of a car</span>
        <span><kbd>Click</kbd> fire</span>
        <span><kbd>Drag</kbd> orbit</span>
      </div>
      <div class="briefs">
        <div class="brief">
          <b>Missions</b>
          Four jobs on the amber beacon: Hot Wire, Docks Run, Packages, The Vault. Hot Wire pays
          only when the lifted car is standing still inside the drop ring.
        </div>
        <div class="brief wanted">
          <b>Wanted system</b>
          Shots and shunts add heat. At two stars the radio sends two to four cars that ram you;
          stay out of sight for twenty seconds and a star comes off, and at zero the street is
          empty again. Red dots on the minimap are units.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hint">Click play, then drag the city to look around</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script type="module" src="./src/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
